{"synopsis":"\\[Dari Penulis yang mengerjakan \\<The Heavenly Demon Wants a Quiet Life>! dan dari Studio yang mengerjakan \\<Absolute Regression>, \\<The Return of the Crazy Demon>, \\<The Heavenly Demon Wants a Quiet Life>, dan masih banyak lagi!]\n\nSeratus anak terperangkap di Gunung Hengshan. Hanya satu yang berhasil keluar hidup-hidup, seorang anak laki-laki bernama Dan Hyeongwoo.\n\nIa bertahan dari neraka yang diciptakan oleh Cheon Gija dan sebagai gantinya memperoleh kekuatan yang layak disebut sebagai kekuatan dewa iblis. Namun, dunia terasa asing baginya, dan aturan-aturannya sama sekali tak masuk akal…\n\nKarena itu, ia menjadi seorang pendekar pengawal di Agen Pengawalan Henan, mempelajari kembali apa arti menjadi manusia dan bagaimana dunia bekerja, dari nol.\n\nSemua yang ia lakukan hanya demi satu tujuan: hari ketika ia akan menuntut balas pada Cheon Gija.","alternative_title":"마신","author":"Woo","artist":"JHS Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"16662340-de1d-4cbb-b948-500d4ceaf072","number":"32","chapter":"32","title":"","date":"2026-05-25","released":"2026-05-25"},{"chapter_id":"c3fe78a6-3659-4613-bd4d-6848e0298622","number":"31","chapter":"31","title":"","date":"2026-05-21","released":"2026-05-21"},{"chapter_id":"ca4cee93-465b-41ed-92ef-7f0701dc1b63","number":"30","chapter":"30","title":"","date":"2026-05-11","released":"2026-05-11"},{"chapter_id":"125e1282-d36d-4fb5-bfa0-6d306ab2215f","number":"29","chapter":"29","title":"","date":"2026-05-06","released":"2026-05-06"},{"chapter_id":"1065a4cd-e525-4305-942d-48555db6d4ba","number":"28","chapter":"28","title":"","date":"2026-05-05","released":"2026-05-05"},{"chapter_id":"3c3bb2db-7203-49dc-83fa-942757f9f94b","number":"27","chapter":"27","title":"","date":"2026-04-18","released":"2026-04-18"},{"chapter_id":"7a5f51fc-bae9-45cf-97d3-7e2f2c916d7d","number":"26","chapter":"26","title":"","date":"2026-04-11","released":"2026-04-11"},{"chapter_id":"d79ea7e7-378c-4781-9669-109cb6a7bc78","number":"25","chapter